{"case_id":"C021","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["entry point","API protocol","state","input semantics","attack surface"],"confidence":100,"affected_functions":["decoder.decode_frame?","decoder.do_decode_frame?","decoder.decode_dht?","decoder.calculate_huff_tables!","decoder.decode_sos?","decoder.decode_dri?","decoder.restart_frame!"],"reason":"H0 exclusively initializes and exercises wuffs_json__decoder and wuffs_aux::DecodeJson; it never initializes or calls the JPEG decoder. Consequently, S1's JPEG marker parser, DHT table construction, scan transition, suspension behavior, and restart-state reset are wholly unreachable from the harness despite processing attacker-controlled JPEG bytes and maintaining substantial indexed table state.","evidence":["H0 defines WUFFS_CONFIG__MODULE__JSON and WUFFS_CONFIG__MODULE__AUX__JSON, but no JPEG module, and all three paths fuzz_complex, fuzz_simple, and fuzz_cpp invoke JSON decoding only.","S1 adds marker-driven input parsing in decoder.do_decode_frame?, including DHT (0xC4), SOS (0xDA), DQT (0xDB), DRI (0xDD), APPn, COM, RSTn, byte stuffing, fill bytes, payload lengths, and truncated reads.","decoder.decode_dht? consumes attacker-controlled code counts and symbols and indexes huff_tables_symbols[tc4_th], while decoder.calculate_huff_tables! constructs huff_tables_slow and huff_tables_fast using derived counts, bit lengths, prefixes, and repetition counts.","decoder.restart_frame! now restores saved_restart_interval and clears all eight seen_dht entries, creating a stateful decode/restart/redecode protocol that H0 never invokes.","decoder.decode_frame? explicitly handles $short read and closed-input truncation, while H0's streaming and buffer-limit checks apply only to wuffs_json__decoder__decode_tokens."],"recommended_action":"Add a JPEG-specific fuzz harness that initializes wuffs_jpeg__decoder, exercises the image-decoder call sequence through configuration and frame decoding with varied source chunking/closure, feeds arbitrary marker streams and DHT payloads, and invokes restart_frame! followed by re-decoding at varied io_position values. Check suspension progress, buffer bounds, status consistency, and decoder reuse across DRI/DHT/SOS sequences."}
